# Direct calls to the mock for testing during development (in the demo, ABMI calls the mock).
# Run from top to bottom; after a restart of the mock, the numbers in the comments are correct.
@base = http://localhost:8081/sap/opu/odata/sap

### 1. Get stock (Material Stock): Enoxaparin on ST03 has 6 pieces
GET {{base}}/API_MATERIAL_STOCK_SRV/A_MatlStkInAcctMod

### 2. Post consumption on ward 3: 2 pieces of Enoxaparin (Material Document, movement type 201)
POST {{base}}/API_MATERIAL_DOCUMENT_SRV/A_MaterialDocumentHeader
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "GoodsMovementCode": "03",
  "MaterialDocumentHeaderText": "Zi. 12, Fr. Müller",
  "to_MaterialDocumentItem": {
    "results": [
      {
        "Material": "MED-ENOX40",
        "Plant": "1710",
        "StorageLocation": "ST03",
        "GoodsMovementType": "201",
        "QuantityInEntryUnit": "2",
        "EntryUnit": "PC",
        "CostCenter": "17101301"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### 3. Get stock again: Enoxaparin on ST03 now has 4 pieces
GET {{base}}/API_MATERIAL_STOCK_SRV/A_MatlStkInAcctMod

### 4. Error case: consume more than available → 400 with SAP error M7/021, stock stays at 4
POST {{base}}/API_MATERIAL_DOCUMENT_SRV/A_MaterialDocumentHeader
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "GoodsMovementCode": "03",
  "to_MaterialDocumentItem": {
    "results": [
      {
        "Material": "MED-ENOX40",
        "Plant": "1710",
        "StorageLocation": "ST03",
        "GoodsMovementType": "201",
        "QuantityInEntryUnit": "100",
        "EntryUnit": "PC",
        "CostCenter": "17101301"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### 5. Another ward: 1 piece of Morphine on ward 1 (Surgery), with its own storage location and cost center
POST {{base}}/API_MATERIAL_DOCUMENT_SRV/A_MaterialDocumentHeader
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "GoodsMovementCode": "03",
  "MaterialDocumentHeaderText": "OP-Saal 2",
  "to_MaterialDocumentItem": {
    "results": [
      {
        "Material": "MED-MORPH10",
        "Plant": "1710",
        "StorageLocation": "ST01",
        "GoodsMovementType": "201",
        "QuantityInEntryUnit": "1",
        "EntryUnit": "PC",
        "CostCenter": "17101101"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### 6. Error case: material does not exist at the storage location → 400 with STOCK_NOT_FOUND
POST {{base}}/API_MATERIAL_DOCUMENT_SRV/A_MaterialDocumentHeader
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "GoodsMovementCode": "03",
  "to_MaterialDocumentItem": {
    "results": [
      {
        "Material": "MED-ONDAN4",
        "Plant": "1710",
        "StorageLocation": "ST01",
        "GoodsMovementType": "201",
        "QuantityInEntryUnit": "1",
        "EntryUnit": "PC",
        "CostCenter": "17101101"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### 7. Create a purchase order: 50 pieces of Enoxaparin for ward 3 (Purchase Order); the answer contains the number, e.g. 4500000001
POST {{base}}/API_PURCHASEORDER_PROCESS_SRV/A_PurchaseOrder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "CompanyCode": "1710",
  "PurchaseOrderType": "NB",
  "Supplier": "17300001",
  "PurchasingOrganization": "1710",
  "PurchasingGroup": "001",
  "to_PurchaseOrderItem": {
    "results": [
      {
        "Material": "MED-ENOX40",
        "Plant": "1710",
        "StorageLocation": "ST03",
        "OrderQuantity": "50",
        "PurchaseOrderQuantityUnit": "PC"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### 8. Get all purchase orders: IsCompletelyDelivered is still false
GET {{base}}/API_PURCHASEORDER_PROCESS_SRV/A_PurchaseOrder

### 9. Goods receipt for the order (Material Document, movement type 101): stock of Enoxaparin on ST03 goes up by 50
POST {{base}}/API_MATERIAL_DOCUMENT_SRV/A_MaterialDocumentHeader
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "GoodsMovementCode": "01",
  "MaterialDocumentHeaderText": "Lieferung",
  "to_MaterialDocumentItem": {
    "results": [
      {
        "Material": "MED-ENOX40",
        "Plant": "1710",
        "StorageLocation": "ST03",
        "GoodsMovementType": "101",
        "QuantityInEntryUnit": "50",
        "EntryUnit": "PC",
        "PurchaseOrder": "4500000001",
        "PurchaseOrderItem": "10"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### 10. Error case: the same goods receipt again → 400 with M7/022, the order is already completely delivered
POST {{base}}/API_MATERIAL_DOCUMENT_SRV/A_MaterialDocumentHeader
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "GoodsMovementCode": "01",
  "to_MaterialDocumentItem": {
    "results": [
      {
        "Material": "MED-ENOX40",
        "Plant": "1710",
        "StorageLocation": "ST03",
        "GoodsMovementType": "101",
        "QuantityInEntryUnit": "50",
        "PurchaseOrder": "4500000001",
        "PurchaseOrderItem": "10"
      }
    ]
  }
}
